WEBVTT

00:04:29.594 --> 00:04:33.136
And even in that hard-to-imagine future
beyond the pandemic,

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:37.006
at least some of this shift to remote work
is probably here to stay.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:38.713
So, how do we do it well?

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:43.566
As teams, we need to figure out
how to stay connected and collaborative.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.606
As individuals, we're all seeking guidance

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.091
on how to stay sane
when we're working alone.

00:04:48.559 --> 00:04:51.596
Recorded caller 1: So, I'm incredibly
vulnerable and scared

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.926
of losing some of the relationships

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.486
that have taken a long time to build

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:59.846
and not having the edge of my personality

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.516
and my ability to communicate
clearly face-to-face.